		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rotting undead priest, blood weeping from empty sockets. Forms malign cabals of faith.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (chain), <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 mace +3 (1d6 + steal faith), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cabal</strong>. Two to five herecites can form a telepathic link, share senses and knowledge.</p><p></p><p><strong>Desecration Aura</strong>. Attempts to cast turn undead on herecite have DISADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Steal Faith</strong>. Non-chaotic divine spellcasters, CHA 15+ or unable to cast spells for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
